Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: runtest.c
Line: 2699
Function: streamProcessTest
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: When rng is non-NULL and xmlTextReaderRelaxNGValidate returns < 0, the code calls fclose(t) without ensuring t is non-NULL. If result is NULL, t remains NULL (it is only opened when result != NULL), leading to fclose(NULL) and a crash.

